{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_06",
  "title": "被包围者",
  "storyCode": "NL-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ddc7e555af9af003f81ecd3e601282777ac9676ae15a6d06ebba551b0c2d1cf5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 6-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "别骗自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "想想我们的遭遇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "在地下竞技场和野兽厮杀，和同伴厮杀，每一场比赛留下的都是实打实的伤痛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "主办方要看到更多的鲜血和刺激，假赛，场外的阴谋诡计。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "这一切都是因为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "再看看那些卡瓦莱利亚基之外的地方吧，感染者有何处可去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......何处可去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "我们身患矿石病，绝症，我们迟早会死，我们的死还会给周围带来灾难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "我们是不祥的，是不可控的，是被排斥的异类。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "监正会真的会允许感染者建立正规骑士团吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "卡西米尔......不，这片大地真的还有感染者存续的空间吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "就算有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰米",
      "text": "......又与你何干呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员A",
      "text": "这家伙，已经一动不动了啊......死了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员B",
      "text": "但愿吧，我是真的不想和感染者厮杀，要是我也被感染了怎么办......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员B",
      "text": "你去确认一下吧，如果真的死了，就让善后小组来处理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "说谁，死了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......来啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "该死的......无胄盟！我要......打败你们所有人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "残害......感染者的......凶手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员A",
      "text": "......她还有力气动？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员A",
      "text": "浑身是血，站都站不稳，何必勉强呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "来......来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "谁也别......想走......咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员B",
      "text": "......也算挺有骨气的，给她个痛快吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员B",
      "text": "反正再这样下去，过个几分钟她就要失血而死了，啧啧，莫妮克的手法还真娴熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "放心吧，你很快就会解脱——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无胄盟的动作突然停了下来。\n脚步声。\n厚重的脚步声，不同于这些杀手的轻巧，仿佛背负着千斤重石的脚步声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "（模糊的对话）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "（他们......在说什么......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "（模糊的对话）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "（......？他们为什么......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "不......别走......站......住！我还......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......已经够了，骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你做得很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客A",
      "text": "怎么了？怎么突然一片漆黑！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客B",
      "text": "发生什么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "哈！？怎么街道上全都没电了！？天呐，这要赔多少钱？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "喂，那边的骑士，来帮忙疏散观众啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "嘿咻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......唔啊，外面真的一片漆黑呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "格蕾纳蒂他们做得也太绝了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......联合会大楼有独立的电源......啧，时间不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "唔！有人来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工A",
      "text": "刚才为什么断电了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工B",
      "text": "看外面！整座城市都——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工A",
      "text": "难、难道又是动力炉出了问题......？大隔断？大隔断重演了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "别慌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工A",
      "text": "啊，马克维茨先生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......万幸的是，今天正好是发言人会议。几位董事此刻也都在联合会大楼内，安然无恙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "没错。听从安排，疏导群众，立刻联系监正会代表，首要任务是确保治安不会出问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......各个城区应该有自己的备用电源，让各区负责人妥善处理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......董事会议......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "不，当务之急是要找到机房的入口——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "text": "青金阁下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......事情闹得真大条啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "所以我早说了嘛，对待感染者就应该当机立断一些，不要给他们机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "幸好今天董事们把我叫来了，不然各位老板出了什么岔子可怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......事后会对这些事件进行复盘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "没问题，但是现在无胄盟的大部分兵力......以及莫妮克都被派去围剿感染者了，现在赶回来恐怕要点时间......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......明白了。那么在这期间，就麻烦你放下原本的任务，保证董事们的安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "好，但我想......总不能有人真的对董事会出手吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......围剿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "不......他们不会有事的......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "必须赶快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......千万不要有事，艾沃娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "你在哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "远牙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......塑料骑士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "你看见其他人了吗，他们摧毁了我们的通讯——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "没那么简单，这里可是城市中心，能切断我们的通讯，说明从一开始我们的通讯频段就被截获了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "电力瘫痪也不是灰毫骑士做的，她还没来得及突击，动力炉就先一步遭到了袭击，现在，她已经赶去接应焰尾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "无胄盟......一直在打着什么算盘，而且一直在嫁祸给感染者——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "快找到其他人，我们的处境很危险！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "艾沃娜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高傲的感染者骑士倒在血泊之中。\n鲜血染红了她的铠甲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "艾沃娜！醒醒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "还、还有呼吸......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "瑟奇亚克，来搭把手——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "......慢着，这附近......有别的人来过？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "无胄盟可没有使用战斧的刺客......就算有，这个痕迹......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "墙面......在渗血？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "text": "是他......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......下载完成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "这就是......零号地块的计划书......还有无胄盟的内部资料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......这么简单就得手，还真是让人不适应。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "先从这个鬼地方爬出去——啊，我的尾巴——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "text": "别愣着！快去联系国民院的人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "text": "还有你，你们部门不是应该负责炎刃竞技场的疏散吗？动起来啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米尔骑士",
      "text": "我们来接发言人小姐，她还在二楼吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "（一片混乱......正好。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "（但愿能顺利离开......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......不会吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "（！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "真有人敢趁乱混进联合会大楼吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "（被发现了——！？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "呜啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "痛痛痛......这里是哪里......刚才原来靠在门边吗，我都没注意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "好黑啊，呃，会议室吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "得找到出去的路——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "索娜一直觉得自己在努力抗争着什么。\n对抗无胄盟，对抗商业联合会，对抗关于感染者的一切不公，对抗命运。\n她其实从未怀疑过自己行为的必要性。\n只是在这个瞬间，有一股从头到脚的寒意，令她一时有些动摇。\n这确实是她第一次动摇。\n就像盛夏时节看见一座如山的冰雕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "铃声在响。\n回荡在空无一人的室内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......喂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "......焰尾骑士，索娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "辛苦你做了这一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......欸......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "你现在，有两个选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "此时，“青金”罗伊就在你所处的会议室门外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "交易很简单。你手里有两份信息存储设备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "交出无胄盟的那份，零号地块的情报你可以带走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "这足够你们在监正会那里，换取合法生活的权利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "我觉得你别无选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "一切尽在把握，焰尾骑士。我无意针对感染者，更无意针对你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "骑士也好，商人也好，感染者也好，都目光狭隘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "别与社会为敌，感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "服务器已经被我们摧毁，你手里的芯片即是最后的副本。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "做出选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "............",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "或者，你此刻正打算砸掉这台电话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "那就这么做吧，如果你觉得，这就是你反抗命运的答案的话——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......哇，他是不是猜到了？真厉害哎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "那么，现在，青金就在门外，我该怎么办呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......这里是几楼来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "这——是不是——有点高！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "索娜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "小灰！接住我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "——你又在做什么？那么高——哇——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "疼疼疼......还好用法术缓冲了一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "干、干嘛这么看着我？好啦，我以后不乱来了......放开我的尾巴好吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "......不，只是......你没事，太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "我们还没来得及突袭动力炉，就被人捷足先登了，有人在利用我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......没关系，至少我们要的东西拿到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "这就是......这一个小小的数据芯片......就能决定我们的去向？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "现在只能祈祷它能了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......唔啊，这得有十几米吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "还挺活蹦乱跳的啊，感染者，没吃够苦头吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "......！你那装扮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "你认得我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "无胄盟的高层对于普通骑士而言一直是个谜......但是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "“青金”罗伊，这十多年来唯一一个没有更替过的青金杀手，你出现的传言逸闻多了，那大家就都认识你啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "真的？哈哈，出名是很高兴啦，不过作为一个杀手太有名气，也不是好事，毕竟无胄盟和骑士不一样，名气可不能变现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "交出芯片，活着离开。还是我杀了你们之后，再拿走芯片？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "我个人是不太喜欢没钱的厮杀就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "......索娜，你还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "嘿咻，没事，但这可是一场苦战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "活下来就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "嘿，我们有多久没有真正并肩作战了？和钳兽战斗的时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......再怎么讲，也别把我和钳兽相提并论啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "还好准备了备用灯......没想到真会有派上用场的一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "怎么了？又来一次大隔断不成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "外面真的都停电了！喂，开什么玩笑，这可是特锦赛期间！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "电力很快就会恢复的......但是，究竟是谁，能让这座不夜城失去光辉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......荒唐。真是荒唐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
